        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBAF-AE Frosted Acrylic Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>Made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest frosted acrylic available. The acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading.  These are great pulls for glass shower doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBAF-AE Frosted Acrylic Shower Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>45 Degree Angle Cut Ends</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Bracket Finishes: 3</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Standard Lengths</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-SD-CFRBAF-AE-12 - Total Length: 12\" : Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-SD-CFRBAF-AE-18 - Total Length: 18\" : Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-SD-CFRBAF-AE-24 - Total Length: 24\" : Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: The center to center can be adjusted to your specifications. Also available in other sizes and bracket finishes, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</a></b> for more information.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
