                "description": "First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBAF-AE  Frosted Acrylic Angled End Shower Door Pulls - Available in 12 inch, 18 inch or 24 inch lengths. Made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest frosted acrylic available. The acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading.  These are great pulls for glass shower doors.",
